<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to JS Challenge!</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        h1 {
            color: #f39c12;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .logo {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .logo img {
            max-width: 180px;
        }
        .question-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            color: #f39c12;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #f1c40f;
            color: #2c3e50;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 20px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .button:hover {
            background-color: #f39c12;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #7f8c8d;
        }
        .code-snippet {
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            border-radius: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
        }
        .language-javascript {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            overflow-x: scroll;
            white-space: pre;
            word-wrap: normal;
            line-height: 1.5;
            tab-size: 2;
            hyphens: none;
            -webkit-hyphens: none;
             -moz-hyphens: none;
              -ms-hyphens: none;
               hyphens: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="logo">
            <img src="/api/placeholder/180/180" alt="JS Challenge Logo">
        </div>
        <h1>Welcome to JS Challenge!</h1>
        <p>Hello {{ name }},</p>
        <p>You're just one step away from unlocking the world of JavaScript! We're thrilled to have you join JS Challenge, your personal coding dojo for mastering JavaScript.</p>
        <p>Ready to start your coding adventure? First ?</p>
        <p class="question-title">What is JS Challenge?</p>
        <p>JS Challenge is a coding dojo for mastering JavaScript. It's designed to help you learn the fundamentals of JavaScript, from the basics to advanced concepts. Whether you're a beginner or an experienced developer, JS Challenge has something for everyone.</p>
        <p>Here's a sneak peek of what you'll be learning:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Working with arrays and objects</li>
            <li>Functions and scope</li>
            <li>Conditional statements and loops</li>
            <li>Asynchronous programming</li>
            <li>Error handling and debugging</li>
            <li>Regular expressions and string manipulation</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="code-snippet">
            <code class="language-javascript">
                const numbers = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5];
                console.log(numbers.length);
                for (let i = 0; i < numbers.length; i++) {
                &nbsp;&nbsp;console.log(numbers[i]);
                }
            </code>
        </div>
        <p>Can't wait to see what amazing things you'll build with JavaScript!</p>
        <p>Happy coding!</p>
        <p>The JS Challenge Team</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; {{ currentYear }} JS Challenge. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>If you have any questions, reach out to us at support@jschallenge.com</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>